Install Docker

Run the following commmands
docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/mssql/server 
  **downloads the SQL image
docker run -e "ACCEPT_EULA=Y" -e "SA_PASSWORD=StrongPassword1" -p 1433:1433 --name sqltest -d mcr.microsoft.com/mssql/server
  **Creates a new image named sqltest
  **Replace StrongPassword1 with your own strong password
  **Runs on port 1433
docker ps
  **Shows if image is up and running

At this point, the image is up and running with SQL
Install SMSS to connect to the database using credentials used in your Docker run command.  
  username:  sa
  password:  what you replaced StrongPassword1 with
  port:  1433
  Host:  localhost

